    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener><dateline><date when="1946-11-13">November 13, 1946</date></dateline>
                    <salute>My dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Dr.
                            Tillich</rs>:</salute></opener>
                <p>Thank you most heartily for your good review of <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__300"
                        type="person">Dr. Brunner</rs>&apos;s book, <rs type="work"
                        ref="#tillich__ASPVVH5A">REVELATION AND REASON</rs>.<note type="ea">Vgl. <rs
                            ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Paul Tillich</rs>: <rs
                            type="work" ref="#tillich__IVS4G69U">Emil Brunner: Revelation and Reason
                            (1946)</rs> (1947).</note> We are indeed happy to have it for the
                    Westminster Bookman and appreciate your kindness in doing us this service.</p>
                <closer><salute>Sincerely yours,</salute><signed><hi rend="hand"><rs
                                ref="#tillich_person_id__4726" type="person">Ada
                        Searon</rs></hi><lb/>Assistant to the Editors</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
